[TEXT]
Title=Julia Jackson (Cameron 1867) in taquete on 6 shafts
Author=thedailyfable
Address=https://booyaka101.github.io/thedailyfable/day41/
Notes=Taquete (weft-faced compound tabby). Shafts 1-2 bind, shafts 3+ carry the pattern warp. Two wefts per pass, white then black, order alternating each pass. Weave weft-faced: beat hard, warp should not show.

